# Modules that do not yet survive tooling/verify-standalone-modules.sh -- a debt register, not
# an exemption. Matching is strict both ways: an unlisted failure fails the lane, and so does a
# listed module that passes.
#
# Format: "<stage> <module-dir>". `resolve`: a consumer cannot fetch or build it. `test`: fine
# for a consumer, but its own tests read files from outside the module directory.

